{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 37, :comments ["<b>And the thing was good in the eyes of Pharaoh.</b> They saw that it was good counsel and of great benefit to the king, to the great ones of the kingdom, and to the common people of the land; therefore it found favor and they assented to his words. And concerning this Solomon said (Proverbs 22:11): ״אוהב טהור לב חן שפתיו רעהו מלך״."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:19:27.254766303Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}